 "extension": {
  "lang": "EN",
  "description": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(81, 85, 96);\">In the Harmonised indices of consumer prices (HICP), item weights are assigned to all goods and services as well as special aggregates,&nbsp;determining&nbsp;their share in the calculation of the higher-level indices.&nbsp;They are updated annually and for each country and year, the item weights add up to 1,000.&nbsp;</span>This dataset is compiled according to the European Classification of Individual Consumption According to Purpose (ECOICOP) ver. 2.</p>",
